    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/WillyTv9/dlt-chat-plugin/zipball/v0.4.0",
    "body": "## What's New\n\n### Bulk Analyzer\n- Batch LLM log classification with worker thread (chunked processing, pause/resume/cancel)\n- Search by tag or category across classified entries\n- Integrated into plugin lifecycle and config\n\n### Error Categorization\n- New **Categorizza** quick action button\n- Classifies error/fatal entries into 7 categories: Comunicazione, Memoria, Sicurezza, Configurazione, Hardware, Timeout, Protocollo\n- Italian and English command variants (categorizza/categorize/classifica)\n\n### LLM Enhancements\n- **Circuit breaker**: 5 consecutive failures -> 60s open state\n- **Rate limiter**: token bucket (10 tokens, 1 token/sec refill)\n- **LRU cache**: 1000 entry response cache (async + sync paths)\n- **Retry with exponential backoff + jitter** on sync path\n\n### Documentation\n- README: updated quick actions count (21), Categorizza button, fixed config example\n- USER_MANUAL: added Categorizza to UI diagram and buttons table\n- ARCHITECTURE: added error categorization details\n- INSTALL: new installation guide\n\n### Tests\n- 5 test classes (RuleBasedAnalyzer, AutomotiveLogParser, LLM utils, CSV export, UserFilterManager)\n- 13 test files, 1207 lines of test code"
  },
